--- discord ---
### Quack
Quack keeps track of moderation cases. Rules managers set up rules on the dashboard, moderators apply them, and Quack picks the outcome and carries it out.
**Moderators:** </case add:1001>, </case view:1001>, </case list:1001>, </case history:1001>, </case void:1001>, </appeals:1002>
**Rules:** </rules:1003> (rules are edited on the dashboard)
**Setup:** </setup:1004> (needs Manage Server)
Use </help:1005> with a topic for more.
buttons: [Open the dashboard](https://quack.example/guilds/111/cases/12)
